    },
    {
      "id": "u_b7fae963cb1f5b8c6793dd24_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you are running the Trilium server under a __TRILIUM_PH_0__reverse proxy__TRILIUM_PH_1__, it's important to configure it as a trusted proxy so that the application can correctly identify the real IP address of the clients. Trilium uses that address for __TRILIUM_PH_2__brute-force protection__TRILIUM_PH_3__, for the failed sign-in entries in its logs and to detect whether the connection was made over HTTPS.",
      "sourceHash": "b7fae963cb1f5b8c6793dd24226745e08928d4746557d428c3c5e08dea5d0d15",
      "context": "Trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "e708f76d9c728b6dbe5353ecdd39036d7c11dadde67f30ed63c4d70957077fd9",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Triliumサーバーを__TRILIUM_PH_0__リバースプロキシ__TRILIUM_PH_1__配下で実行している場合は、アプリケーションがクライアントの実際のIPアドレスを正しく識別できるように、信頼されたプロキシとして設定することが重要です。Triliumは、そのアドレスを__TRILIUM_PH_2__総当たり攻撃からの保護__TRILIUM_PH_3__、ログ内のサインイン失敗エントリ、および接続がHTTPS経由で行われたかどうかの検出に使用します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7c9bb348a470e8e2b811766b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Without this setting, every request appears to come from the reverse proxy, so all clients share a single limit of failed sign-in attempts.",
      "sourceHash": "7c9bb348a470e8e2b811766bd32d5a34475aaa1b308006354a330e1d43d2aeea",
      "context": "Trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "e708f76d9c728b6dbe5353ecdd39036d7c11dadde67f30ed63c4d70957077fd9",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "この設定を行わないと、すべてのリクエストがリバースプロキシからのものとして表示されるため、すべてのクライアントがサインイン失敗の試行回数に関する制限を共有することになります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f388e3c6d00390fb5d1a2bee_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Configuring the trusted proxy__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "f388e3c6d00390fb5d1a2beee18dbcd82c41b9fed136b018bba15b2fcf0a0cfa",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
