    {
      "id": "u_adf100cc22aaa2ea55f1de0d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To trust the reverse proxy, modify __TRILIUM_PH_0__Configuration (config.ini or environment variables)__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and set __TRILIUM_PH_2__ to the address the reverse proxy connects to Trilium from:",
      "sourceHash": "adf100cc22aaa2ea55f1de0dbeecf2e48daf226cb1f5872d0f88e4d78d1aac24",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "b29bb46ecf90c968d1eef13e6645709c91fb082894bfa4d8f17edf1e48d06efc",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "リバースプロキシを信頼するには、__TRILIUM_PH_0__設定（config.iniまたは環境変数）__TRILIUM_PH_1__を修正し、__TRILIUM_PH_2__にリバースプロキシがTriliumへ接続する際のアドレスを設定します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_53ffcac66729bd06ba051385_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The value is a comma-separated list of IP addresses, subnets in CIDR notation or one of the following names:",
      "sourceHash": "53ffcac66729bd06ba0513851df4a84cb6aace60d24ba28b5cceaa7646b27bf6",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "b29bb46ecf90c968d1eef13e6645709c91fb082894bfa4d8f17edf1e48d06efc",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "値は、カンマ区切りのIPアドレス、CIDR表記のサブネット、または以下のいずれかの名前です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
