    {
      "id": "u_fb4653ca96786ef0b39dc051_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium then reads the client's address from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ header, taking the right-most entry that does not belong to a trusted address. Entries a client adds to the header are to the left of the ones the proxy appends, so they are ignored.",
      "sourceHash": "fb4653ca96786ef0b39dc0512fea2ae3f357600bcffe91d7c33a311377be8eac",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "b29bb46ecf90c968d1eef13e6645709c91fb082894bfa4d8f17edf1e48d06efc",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "次にTriliumは、__TRILIUM_PH_0__ヘッダーからクライアントのアドレスを読み取ります。その際、信頼されたアドレスに属さない最も右側のエントリを採用します。クライアントがヘッダーに追加したエントリはプロキシが追加したエントリの左側にあるため、無視されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
