    {
      "id": "u_9a4e97b521609d861267870c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__The reverse proxy runs on the same machine__TRILIUM_PH_1__: use __TRILIUM_PH_2__.",
      "sourceHash": "9a4e97b521609d861267870ce75b7616372800bc907594bfca51e88de677a47f",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "b29bb46ecf90c968d1eef13e6645709c91fb082894bfa4d8f17edf1e48d06efc",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__リバースプロキシが同じマシン上で実行されている場合__TRILIUM_PH_1__：__TRILIUM_PH_2__を使用します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_74c66c5a80b454e7bcc03293_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Trilium runs in Docker, with the reverse proxy on the host or in another container__TRILIUM_PH_1__: use the subnet of the Docker network (for example __TRILIUM_PH_2__), or __TRILIUM_PH_3__ to cover every Docker network. With the environment variable: __TRILIUM_PH_4__.",
      "sourceHash": "74c66c5a80b454e7bcc0329371a8772b1580d5eb4f8a6d270c698387971d337d",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "b29bb46ecf90c968d1eef13e6645709c91fb082894bfa4d8f17edf1e48d06efc",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__TriliumがDocker内で実行されており、リバースプロキシがホスト上または別のコンテナにある場合__TRILIUM_PH_1__：Dockerネットワークのサブネット（例：__TRILIUM_PH_2__）、またはすべてのDockerネットワークをカバーする__TRILIUM_PH_3__を使用します。環境変数の場合：__TRILIUM_PH_4__。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ec32fed8af0b54ad0e9eb0d8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__The reverse proxy runs on another machine__TRILIUM_PH_1__: use its IP address.",
      "sourceHash": "ec32fed8af0b54ad0e9eb0d8277d976fd8929776e67b3b1c5c62c99a436995ae",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "b29bb46ecf90c968d1eef13e6645709c91fb082894bfa4d8f17edf1e48d06efc",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__リバースプロキシが別のマシン上で実行されている場合__TRILIUM_PH_1__：そのIPアドレスを使用します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a5003b3c79dd5947a5817a79_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Only list addresses that the reverse proxy connects from. Any client connecting from a trusted address can claim to be another client through the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ header. This matters for broad values such as __TRILIUM_PH_1__: if devices on your local network can also reach Trilium directly, use the proxy's exact address instead.",
      "sourceHash": "a5003b3c79dd5947a5817a79d33e2c128dc81feff4737bce6295902a429138a3",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "b29bb46ecf90c968d1eef13e6645709c91fb082894bfa4d8f17edf1e48d06efc",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "リバースプロキシの接続元アドレスのみをリストしてください。信頼されたアドレスから接続するすべてのクライアントは、__TRILIUM_PH_0__ ヘッダーを通じて別のクライアントであると偽る可能性があります。これは __TRILIUM_PH_1__ のような広範な値の場合に重要となります。ローカルネットワーク上のデバイスも Trilium に直接アクセスできる場合は、プロキシの正確なアドレスを使用してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_caf0bfd002f08eff8fd60d6d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Avoid setting __TRILIUM_PH_0__. It makes Trilium use the left-most entry of __TRILIUM_PH_1__, which is the value the client sent, unless the proxy discards the incoming header. Proxies usually append to it instead (such as Nginx's __TRILIUM_PH_2__), so a client can send a different address with every request and bypass the limit on failed sign-in attempts.",
      "sourceHash": "caf0bfd002f08eff8fd60d6d5cc5db36e335239c4dd5bc45baece24f220ed22c",
      "context": "Trusted proxy > Configuring the trusted proxy",
      "contextHash": "b29bb46ecf90c968d1eef13e6645709c91fb082894bfa4d8f17edf1e48d06efc",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ の設定は避けてください。これにより、プロキシが受信ヘッダーを破棄しない限り、Trilium はクライアントが送信した値である __TRILIUM_PH_1__ の一番左のエントリを使用するようになります。プロキシは通常、代わりに値を追加するため（Nginx の __TRILIUM_PH_2__ など）、クライアントはリクエストごとに異なるアドレスを送信し、ログイン失敗回数の制限を回避することができます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
